  "description": "Chubby Chum – A Playful Bubble Font for Kids\nSay hello to Chubby Chum, a joyful and rounded bubble font made to brighten up every project!\nWith its plump letters, friendly curves, and soft shapes, this font radiates fun and positivity. It’s perfect for children’s books, toy packaging, school projects, birthday invitations, and cute branding.\nChubby Chum brings out that carefree, creative spirit — the kind that makes you want to doodle, color, and smile. Its bold yet adorable look makes every word stand out with personality and charm.\nLet your imagination bounce with Chubby Chum — the perfect mix of playfulness and design confidence.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Chubby Chum – A Playful Bubble Font for Kids</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Say hello to Chubby Chum, a joyful and rounded bubble font made to brighten up every project!</strong></p>\n<p>With its plump letters, friendly curves, and soft shapes, this font radiates fun and positivity. It’s perfect for children’s books, toy packaging, school projects, birthday invitations, and cute branding.</p>\n<p>Chubby Chum brings out that carefree, creative spirit — the kind that makes you want to doodle, color, and smile. Its bold yet adorable look makes every word stand out with personality and charm.</p>\n<p>Let your imagination bounce with Chubby Chum — the perfect mix of playfulness and design confidence.</p>",
